  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 518.04 Approval Criteria for Boat Launches",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 518.04 Approval Criteria for Boat Launches. In addition to meeting all applicable criteria established in Env-Wt 300, the department shall not approve an application for a permit to construct or modify a boat launch unless the applicant demonstrates that the project will provide a public benefit in terms of navigation, rights of public passage, and the rights of the general public to use the resource accessed by the boat launch for commerce and recreation.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
}
